{
  "name": "[x] FPS mouse",
  "comment": "PC FPS with mouse+keyboard native (Portal 2, Half-Life 2). Design: docs/fork/research/touch-genre-profiles.md section 4, enlarged to >= 92 pt (15 mm) and moved inside the 59/59/8/21 pt safe area (the design's 54 pt keys and its top row at x .60-.92 did not fit). Gyro = touch-gyro.md preset A (always-on aim, mouse output): mapGyroTo mouse, yaw 0.45, pitch 0.30. Not placed: preset A's GYROPAUSE ratchet (no free 92 pt slot, the design has none). In-game: mouse smoothing/accel off, sensitivity ~2.0-2.5; Portal 2 has no sprint/reload.",
